course: dictionary
lesson: 3607
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Many words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one the writer wants. The word «fighter» is a good example. Read the words around it and ask: who or what is being called a fighter here?
explain: «Tigress and Crane are fighters in the film.» Here a fighter is a person who fights, like a warrior in a martial arts story. Try the meaning in the sentence to check it still makes sense.
explain: «She's a real fighter» can be said about a sick person who never gives up. Here fighter does not mean someone who hits others. It means someone who keeps trying hard against problems or illness, and that is praise.
fact: A fighter is a person who fights, for example in boxing, martial arts, or a war.
fact: A fighter is also someone who does not give up and keeps trying hard against problems or illness.
fact: A fighter plane is a small, fast military aeroplane made to attack other aircraft.
fact: A firefighter is a person whose job is to put out fires.
fact: Phrases you may meet: «a born fighter», «fighter pilot», «freedom fighter».
exercise: «Tigress and Crane are fighters in the film.» What does fighter mean here? | A kind of aeroplane | A person who cooks food | A tool for putting out fires | *People who fight, like warriors in a martial arts story
exercise: «She's a real fighter» is said about a sick girl who never gives up. What does fighter mean? | A person whose job is to put out fires | Someone who hits other people | A small, fast aeroplane | *Someone who keeps trying hard and never gives up
exercise: Which word means a person whose job is to put out fires? | Fighter plane | *Firefighter | Lifeguard | Fire alarm
test: «Their best fighters were knights, rich horsemen trained from boyhood, who wore heavy armour.» What kind of fighters were the knights? | Pilots who flew in the sky | *Warriors who fought in battles | People who cooked the feasts | Horses that raced in the fields
test: Which of these is a fighter plane? | A helicopter used for rescue | *A small, fast military aeroplane made to attack other aircraft | A paper glider thrown across the playground | A huge passenger jet full of tourists
exam: Pick the sentence where fighter means someone who does not give up. | The fighters wore heavy armour in the battle | *Even after months of illness, Mia is a real fighter who never gives up | The fighter jet roared over the hills | Two fighters trained in the ring all morning
